# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit game data. Belt and braces: none of this is in the tree today and
# these patterns are here to keep it that way.
#
# The cartridge dump is WaterMelon's work. They have ceased trading and the game
# is no longer sold, which does not make it ours to redistribute. The music blob
# is encoded from the released soundtrack - an album, not a game asset. Users
# supply both themselves; scripts/build_cdda.sh plus build_cdda_adpcm.py rebuild
# the blob from your own copy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pcm
wave-bank*.wv
music-modules/
wave-bank*.wav
Paprium.md
# ROM dumps only. Deliberately NOT a bare `paprium.bin`: that also excluded
# pkg/pocket/Platforms/_images/paprium.bin, the core's own platform artwork, so
# the repo shipped no artwork while a clone silently lost it.
**/Assets/**/paprium.bin
/paprium.bin
*.sav
*.srm
sfx-dump/
cdda/
cdda-blob/
